  <jpcrp_cor:NotesSignificantEventsAfterReportingPeriodConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h6&gt;（重要な後発事象）&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: left"&gt;　該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
